    "created_at": "2023-10-25T16:34:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-10-25T16:34:18Z",
    "body": "I did check https://www.w3.org/TR/MathML/chapter2.html#fund.globatt before posting this, and it explicitly says to use `xml:lang`.\r\n\r\n(Also, Gecko's code explicitly allows the unnamespaced `lang` attribute for HTML, SVG, and XUL elements.)",
